[00:13.24]1. We love Jehovah with heart, mind, and soul;
[00:22.24]But since we are sinful, we need self-control.
[00:32.83]Fleshly desires bring trouble and strife;
[00:42.83]Living by spirit brings peace and life.
[01:05.18]2. Satan’s temptations confront us each day,
[01:14.18]And sin’s law within us can lead us astray.
[01:24.96]Power of truth is greater than sin.
[01:33.96]Thanks to Jehovah, our minds can win.
[01:56.06]3. Each word and action reflects on God’s name,
[02:05.06]So we must endeavor to keep free from blame.
[02:17.85]In all we do, we make this our goal:
[02:24.85]Always maintaining our self-control.